# the PRESET encoder on the progression page: P1 DETTIFOSS, then P2 WIDE, P3 FELT, each glided to (the Scene time) and
# heard over the progression's steps at Snap 80 and Thickness 60, which stay where they are; then back to P2 at the
# end (the left end: P1 again). Its banner shot on P2.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
turn ALGO 80
set 87 60
wait 600
wav live-dettifoss.wav
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
wavstop
turn PRESET 1
wait 300
shot live-preset-banner.png
wait 9000
wav live-wide.wav
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
wavstop
turn PRESET 1
wait 9000
wav live-felt.wav
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 2500
wavstop
turn PRESET 5
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
turn PRESET -1
wait 300
shot live-preset-left.png
